{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05005","headline":"神龙初废逐南荒途出郴口北望苏耽山 · 沈佺期","name":"神龙初废逐南荒途出郴口北望苏耽山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少曾读仙史，知有苏耽君。\n流望来南国，依然会昔闻。\n泊舟问耆老，遥指孤山云。\n孤山郴郡北，不与衆山羣。\n重崖下萦映，嶛嶢上乣纷。\n碧峰泉附落，红壁树傍分。\n选地今方尔，昇天因可云。\n不才予窜迹，羽化子遗芬。\n将览成麟凤，旋惊御鬼文。\n此中迷出处，含思独氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}